In my previous analysis, I highlighted two potential buy zones. You can verify them either from the notes on the chart or via this post: </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://x.com/Efloud/status/1997317551169126660?s=20" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">x.com/Efloud/status/…</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">

Among those levels, $219 zone was the one that triggered confirmation, after which the pair rallied +32%. I’m now closing my position with a +27% profit.

If price pulls back, I’m watching two potential re-entry areas: $249 and $230. Alerts are set for both levels.

If the pair breaks the resistance level it previously rejected from with a strong breakout candle, I would consider the red-box area (~$350) as the next resistance zone.

Wishing everyone a great day and profitable trades 🤝</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2008865545559413133/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1858" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-DsZkIWcAA5ySa?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-DsZkIWcAA5ySa?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-DsZkIWcAA5ySa?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-DsZkIWcAA5ySa?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/2008865545559413133/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/2008865545559413133/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="548" height="820" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-Dsbb6WYAAPR-C?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-Dsbb6WYAAPR-C?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-Dsbb6WYAAPR-C?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G-Dsbb6WYAAPR-C?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(ma